WEBVTT

00:12:25.676 --> 00:12:30.076
and it started with a group
of inner city boys

00:12:30.116 --> 00:12:32.556
who were in elementary school
or middle school

00:12:32.596 --> 00:12:35.876
from really disadvantaged,
troubled families.

00:12:35.916 --> 00:12:38.396
And each study was trying to look

00:12:38.436 --> 00:12:42.276
at how people can take
healthy developmental paths.

00:12:42.716 --> 00:12:46.396
And so the idea was not to study
what goes wrong in our lives

00:12:46.436 --> 00:12:48.196
but what goes right in our lives.

00:12:48.236 --> 00:12:52.796
And some of the factors that contribute
to helping things go well

00:12:52.836 --> 00:12:54.636
in human development.

00:12:54.636 --> 00:12:58.796
Needless to say, we started
out with boys, all males,

00:12:58.836 --> 00:13:01.036
but we’ve added women.